    "about": "Anandeswaram Sree Mahadeva Kshethram (Malayalam: ആനന്ദേശ്വര൦ ശ്രീമഹാദേവ ക്ഷേത്ര൦) is one of the oldest temples in Pandanad village. It is located at Pandanad in Chengannur taluk of Alappuzha district in the south Indian state of Kerala. The temple is situated between Chengannur, and Mannar. Anandeswaram Sree Mahadeva Kshethram is a Hindu temple, dedicated to Shiva."
